{"overview":"در ارث‌کلیر، هر کس به نقش ثابتی متولد می‌شود و روستاییان ضعیف‌ترین‌ها هستند؛ اکثر مردم هرگز از سطح ۵ فراتر نمی‌روند—به‌جز کوجی کاگامی که سطح ...۹۹۹ دارد! در یک شکار هیولا، او با آلیس، دختر پادشاه شیاطین، آشنا می‌شود و کشف می‌کند که هر دو رویای غیرممکن همزیستی بین انسان‌ها و شیاطین را دارند؛ در دنیایی که سرنوشتش به درگیری کشیده شده، آن‌ها به نبرد می‌پردازند تا سرنوشت را به چالش بکشند و قوانین را بشکنند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In Earthclear, everyone is born into a fixed role, and villagers are the weakest of all. Most never rise above Level 5—except Koji Kagami, who is Level...999?! On a monster hunt, he meets Alice, the Demon King's daughter, and discovers they share an impossible dream: coexistence between humans and demons. In a world destined for conflict, they charge into battle to defy fate and shatter the rules.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2026,"poster":"/pXnQuQyt7LUb62ZF9J6vDAcymIW.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"猪股慧士","role":"Kouji Kagami (voice)","photo":"/hAoRLGuberMhFY1f6ULJGiIu1e.jpg","en":"Satoshi Inomata"},{"name":"نائو تیاما","role":"Alice (voice)","photo":"/6WJDd1z946yFfZBgpC7dWi0FyQw.jpg","en":"Nao Toyama"},{"name":"江頭宏哉","role":"Takako Bilda (voice)","photo":"/fgcbBLbYNqy4JfVZ5MX8AKrJJl7.jpg","en":"Hiroya Egashira"},{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Krull Hekisaldoria (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg","en":"Manaka Iwami"},{"name":"島﨑信長","role":"Rex (voice)","photo":"/qke5rZusHsjSlvB0NKlJ5dQF5D.jpg","en":"Nobunaga Shimazaki"},{"name":"古賀葵","role":"Tina (voice)","photo":"/uVpwheVV4aPROyY1toYv3v5HSPD.jpg","en":"Aoi Koga"},{"name":"رین","role":"Paruna (voice)","photo":"/eJ2NqgzpnzNbT6Nt9EpDfzqNeZM.jpg","en":"Lynn"}],"trailer":"nKRzpby_5tU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/298994-lv999/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{